          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "Our Microsoft Cloud revenue, which includes Azure and other cloud services, Office 365 Commercial, the commercial portion of LinkedIn, Dynamics 365, and other commercial cloud properties, was $111.6 billion, $91.4 billion, and $69.1 billion in fiscal years 2023, 2022, and 2021, respectively.",
